{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2022-10-03 13:01:00', 'title': 'PFIZER COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF BIOHAVEN PHARMACEUTICALS', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PFIZER INC. (NYSE: PFE) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE COMPLETION OF ITS ACQUISITION OF BIOHAVEN PHARMACEUTICAL HOLDING COMPANY LTD., THE MAKER OF NURTEC® ODT (RIMEGEPANT), AN INNOVATIVE MIGRAINE THERAPY APPROVED FOR BOTH ACUTE TREATMENT AND PREVENTION OF EPISODIC MIGRAINE IN ADULTS. THE ACQUISITION BRINGS TO PFIZER A PORTFOLIO OF PROMISING CALCITONIN GENE-RELATED PEPTIDE (CGRP) RECEPTOR ANTAGONISTS INCLUDING: RIMEGEPANT: APPROVED IN THE UNITED STATES UNDER THE TRADE NAME NURTEC'}